-- Additive patch: adds quarters 2-4 of drill content for each youth
-- stage (Red Starter, Red Rally, Red Game Player, Orange Ready), so a
-- player who stays at one stage across multiple plan quarters sees
-- real escalating difficulty instead of the same content repeated --
-- matching the progression NTRP levels already had via their own
-- quarter field. Safe to run directly: only inserts new rows (quarter
-- 1 of each stage already exists from seed_drill_library.sql and is
-- left untouched), no schema change, no data loss.

